# Mouse buttons are Start (middle), A (left) and B (right); a click is down, two frames, up.
[actions]
connect 2 1
mouse 2 click left
mouse 2 down right
mouse 2 move 1 1
mouse 2 up right
mouse 2 click middle
[expect]
0 2 mouse down left
3 2 mouse up left
4 2 mouse down right
5 2 mouse 1 1
6 2 mouse up right
7 2 mouse down middle
10 2 mouse up middle

[frames]
0 2 00000100000
1 2 00000100000
2 2 00000100000
3 2 00000000000
4 2 00000010000
5 2 01010010000
6 2 01010000000
7 2 01011000000
8 2 01011000000
9 2 01011000000
10 2 01010000000
